<TABLE BORDER=0 cellpadding=4 border=0 cellspacing=1 WIDTH="95%"><TR bgcolor="#E6E8fA"><TD COLSPAN=2><CENTER><FONT SIZE="2" COLOR="#b87333" FACE="Verdana, Arial">T O P I C  &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; R E V I E W</font></CENTER></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Entilzar</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Hi all,<BR>You need to register with this site,Its very easy to do,Just follow the register link at the top of the main forum page.<BR>Once you have registered Post a message on here.<BR><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/images/entilzar.gif"> </FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Inka</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Doh, no more FO or EF board. So sad.<P>------------------<BR><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/images/inka.gif"> </FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Entilzar</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Inka i miss you!!<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/images/entilzar.gif"> </FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Inka</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Chuckle. Lotta Single player games. stuck my toe into EQ the other day. only hurt a little bit.  <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/ubb/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/images/inka.gif"> </FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Wegluan Runsalot</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Hi gang, <P><BR>woot finally got to post here  <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/ubb/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Wegluan Runsalot <P>Lvl 51 Wanderer</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Dexx</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Hey me too !   <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/ubb/smile.gif"><P>Safe Hunting!<BR>Dexx</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">KRYHM</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Hi, most of you don't know me. I joined Sublime just before i deployed to JAPAN. If that sounds familiar thats because I work with WEG in RL. Can't wait to get back to the states to start playing again. <P>Hope to see you guys sometime soon.<P>KRYHM<BR>Just a LOW LVL </FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Bejamez</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">HIYA I remember you.  I help you with Wegulan killing bandits.  Hope to see you two real soon.  Is you wife still playing?</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Banton</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Hello Finally made it.</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Basanee</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Da trolly has arrived!<BR><P>------------------<BR>~Your loving trolly~<BR>Basanee the Dead Sexxxy</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Allys WindyBard</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">WOOT good to see everyone again  <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/ubb/smile.gif"></FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Hanadmer</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">hey i got on today an think this site is great<BR>-Hanadmer 37cleric</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Lionn</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">MEWOWZA , hi all you favorite kitty is in da house i just had to say hi to everyone and am glad to be in SUBLIME again ( this is my 4th char that was in sublime) well im gonna log on and play EQ with you guys c you soon!<P> Lionn Earthenblade 33 BEASTLORD( for now muhahahahahahahaha)<BR></FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Yizzin</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Hi everybody! its everybody's favorite cynic and great thinker here!  that's right, Jonathn Swift, in the flesh!  ok, seriously though hi everyone sorry if i'm a little late on the postage</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Allys WindyBard</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">WOOT im glad everyone is coming back</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Beja</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Hey Yizzin I still have your fish. <IMG SRC="http://www.forsaken.seventhhammer.com/ubb/smile.gif"> When Beja can log back on after she takes care of some RL issues she will find you. She trys to be a woman of her WORD. Or maybe she will see you Sunday.</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Aureanna</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Ok.. I registered!</FONT></TD></TR><TR bgcolor="#000000"><TD valign=top><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Kinay</FONT></TD><TD><FONT SIZE="2" FACE="Verdana, Arial">Oh thats where im supposed to post!<P>Kinay Avabeir<BR>Monky - 50th Seaso</FONT></TD></TR></TABLE>
